1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,100
There's a lake in the middle of a desert.

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,800
Here 2,400mm evaporates a year; 50mm falls.

4
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,300
Yet this crescent spring has never dried.

5
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:11,800
It's Crescent Lake, south of Dunhuang.

6
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:14,200
Around it, dunes rise 250 metres high.

7
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,600
Double-tap if you'd climb this dune.

8
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:19,200
The sand here sings when the wind blows.

9
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:21,800
Silk Road caravans rested at this oasis.

10
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:24,800
* Expert Tip: ride the dunes at sunrise, skip midday heat.

11
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:27,400
Next stop: the Han empire's western gate.
